    <item>
      <title>Patch Notes [04.11.2026]</title>
      <description>&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/efbf47ac59f4a95ca680e0b90c823bd0adae5197.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contents&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;bb_ul&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Festivity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Gifts of Festivity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Final pack&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Other changes and fixes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Festivity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h2&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Progression mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;From November 4 to November 18, you can participate in matches and earn progression points to get even more rewards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&quot;bb_blockquote&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;The progression mode will be available daily from 10:00 to 00:00 (server time).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/6638076391f3e335dc9b515fe37c2cb213ec9eff.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How it works?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/38ca219048e780e37af31d1348c441dd5fce26a6.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h3&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/8b6919d059e62b5047e34aeacc77847a52e3972b.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Before the Epiphany league, progression points are earned for both wins and losses. However, you’ll receive fewer points for a lost match.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Up to round 15, the number of points depends on the length of the match: the further you advance, the more points you'll earn for a win or a loss.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&quot;bb_blockquote&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;For example, a win in the 12th round is worth fewer points than a win in the 15th. At the same time, a win in the 20th round will earn the same number of points as a win in the 15th.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;For completing the progression up to the Revelation league, you will receive a total of:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;bb_ul&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;20 Implements crates;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;30 Standard Spare Parts;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;30 Standard Tools;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;80 Advanced Spare Parts;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;40 Advanced Tools;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Profile stickers;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Paints for armor and weapons;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;150 000 Chrismites.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Rewards are issued immediately: upon advancing to a new league and reaching certain point thresholds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h3&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Epiphany and Deliverance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/38ca219048e780e37af31d1348c441dd5fce26a6.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/cc709f87bee052293e5434664ecfddcf3d99084d.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/9920fd91e160cbe1d3b5a2c6d38cc4d1aac0e3d6.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;In the Epiphany and Deliverance leagues, progression points will be deducted for losses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Rewards for reaching these leagues are issued only &lt;b&gt;after the event ends&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;The Epiphany league will include 10% of the players, and the Deliverance league will include the players with the highest point totals: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;bb_ul&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;EU — 90&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;NA — 15&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;SEA — 10&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;NEA — 10&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Festivity changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;bb_ul&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Fixed an issue where interface elements were displayed incorrectly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Added the ability to go to a player's profile from the Match History tab.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Added the ability to file a complaint against a player during a match. To report player, hover your cursor over the player's nickname in the match statistics and right-click.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;The enemy team's nicknames are now displayed at the end of the match.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Item rank display added to match statistics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/f1cca2ff1f81d55078c779bdfb3ea79204a04e2c.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;bb_ul&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Fixed a bug that caused a player who was in a hideout with their squad to enter the game alone when the match started.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Fixed issues where characters would get stuck in the Arena.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Fixed a bug that caused players to fall off the edge of the map.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Fixed mutant behavior.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Added the ability to open multiple Implements cases at once.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Changed the balance of the Sleepless Paralysis wave.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Fixed a bug that prevented the kill of the His Illustrious Highness boss from being counted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gifts of Festivity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;The holiday season is one of those rare occasions when the Zone is ready to share its treasures. It's true, though, that it's not customary here to look for presents under the tree: you still have to go to the shop for supplies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&quot;bb_blockquote&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Gifts of Festivity are now available in the in-game shop!&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; 35 000 event currency, 20 event crates, 15 season levels, and the Doll-Amulet charm featuring one of several randomly assigned face designs. Which one you'll get is a surprise! The set is rounded out with Final Plea paints for weapons and armor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;And if you're still not in the holiday spirit, your first purchases come with discounts of up to 60%. The Zone is rarely this generous, so it's best not to test its patience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Final pack&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Every journey through the Zone has its own ending. Some are content with whatever they find along the way, while others aren't used to coming away empty-handed. We have a final gift in reserve for them — and it's definitely worth checking out.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&quot;bb_blockquote&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vangard, Prestige, and Ultima&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; — three tiers leading to an impressive collection of rewards. Season levels, Premium, Overdrives, crates, and exclusive cosmetic items will help you finish the season with a solid stash of trophies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;This is your last chance to make the most of season offers. After all, leaving the Zone with an empty backpack isn't really the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Other changes and fixes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;bb_ul&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Adjusted the paint scheme of the RSh-12 in the Inscribed style. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <link><![CDATA[https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1818450/view/719046798538178589]]></link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 07:28:23 +0000</pubDate>
