      <description>&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/050a623b66b48d3f09b9485a6a787e7f689ca7b1.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;ZIVCAS is concerned by Typhoon and Black Market's alliance, alongside the risk of a new monopoly emerging. They can't openly act out against them: Typhoon is a Korean-American contingent, that also provides protection to the Black Market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;To break this partnership up, ZIVCAS sends their operative crisis-manager: Liv Kehler. He devises a plan through which he intends to pit the partners against one another, using the Seeker as his instrument.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;WIll Kehler succeed in executing his plan? You'll find out by completing the &lt;b&gt;Shock Wave&lt;/b&gt; quest.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
