    <item>
      <title>Festivity x Twitch Drops</title>
      <description>&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;To receive rewards for watching streams, first link your EXBO and Twitch accounts.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/8273d4aac238c7d9af020b4dd044c752bae6e4c4.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;🔻&lt;a class=&quot;bb_link&quot; href=&quot;https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.exbo.net%2Fen%2Fhelp-center%2Farticles%2F68%2F70%2F125&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot; noopener&quot; &gt;&lt;u&gt;Detailed guide on how to link your EXBO account&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;🔻&lt;a class=&quot;bb_link&quot; href=&quot;https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.exbo.net%2Fen%2Fhelp-center%2Farticles%2F70%2F70%2F298&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot; noopener&quot; &gt;&lt;u&gt;Detailed guide on how to link Twitch to the game in Steam&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;🔻&lt;a class=&quot;bb_link&quot; href=&quot;https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitch.tv%2Fdrops%2Finventory&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot; noopener&quot; &gt;&lt;u&gt;You can track the status of the rewards on a special page&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/hr&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;bb_h1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How to receive Twitch Drops&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;To claim your rewards, just watch the streams on the channels of our&lt;b&gt; media partners&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;You can watch broadcasts from our Global content makers:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;bb_ul&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;bb_link&quot; href=&quot;https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitch.tv%2Funbannmee6&quot; target=&quot;_blank&qu