    <item>
      <title>Your clip, your rules, your rewards</title>
      <description>&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/41581512/c25d36eeed3d9431acc426e766f32f228c04711d.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;The Zone is full of potential hits. All it takes is the right angle, the perfect moment, and a little of your own madness. Who knows? Your video might just take STALZONE by storm!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The #SZFRAGMENTS Clip Challenge is live!&lt;/b&gt; Create edits, experiment with CGI, or make your own animated shorts inspired by the Festivity event. Post your videos on TikTok or YouTube Shorts, rack up views, and compete for unique rewards!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&quot;bb_blockquote&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;More views, bigger loot!&lt;/b&gt; Earn Wooden Crates, Aesthete Cases, and Anomalous Serums. Top performers will also score exclusive rewards: the Blabberbolt bolt skin, a Profile Customization Pack, and the Manly Pink weapon paint!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;bb_paragraph&quot;&gt;Find all the details, participation rules, and the full list of rewards &lt;a class=&quot;bb_link&quot; href=&quot;https://steamcommunity.com/linkfilter/?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstalzone.com%2Fclip-challenge&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot; noopener&quot; &gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
